  "title": "Monochrome High Contrast UI",
  "description": "Monochrome High Contrast UI is a resource pack designed to completely redesign the Minecraft interface in a minimalist, black-and-white, contrasting style.",
  "body": "![в](https://github.com/MisterL30086/Monochrome-High-Contrast-UI/blob/2.0.X-branch/assets/modrinth%20icons/MHCU%20logo.png?raw=true)\n\nMonochrome High Contrast UI is a resource pack designed to completely redesign the Minecraft interface in a minimalist, black-and-white, contrasting style.\n\nStarting with version 2.0.0, the resource pack covers all Minecraft versions from 1.6 onward, including the April Fool's snapshots. Also starting with this version, the resource pack redesigns the interfaces of several mods; a list of these mods is available in the 2.0.0 changelog.\n\n_Note: Mod support does not cover all Minecraft versions, but only versions from 1.20.2 onward._\n\n![d](https://github.com/MisterL30086/Monochrome-High-Contrast-UI/blob/2.0.X-branch/assets/modrinth%20icons/img1.png?raw=true) ![d](https://github.com/MisterL30086/Monochrome-High-Contrast-UI/blob/2.0.X-branch/assets/modrinth%20icons/img2.png?raw=true) ![d](https://github.com/MisterL30086/Monochrome-High-Contrast-UI/blob/2.0.X-branch/assets/modrinth%20icons/img3.png?raw=true) \n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1WnI1NgbZCrKnUXxAzHfb-8zjoqD1hLI4?usp=sharing\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MisterL30086/Monochrome-High-Contrast-UI/blob/2.0.X-branch/assets/modrinth%20icons/archive%20toast.png?raw=true\" alt=\"archive\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/v6dRCThCp7\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MisterL30086/Monochrome-High-Contrast-UI/blob/2.0.X-branch/assets/modrinth%20icons/discord%20toast.png?raw=true\" alt=\"discord\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/MisterL30086/Monochrome-High-Contrast-UI\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MisterL30086/Monochrome-High-Contrast-UI/blob/2.0.X-branch/assets/modrinth%20icons/github%20toast.png?raw=true\" alt=\"github\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/MisterL30086/Monochrome-High-Contrast-UI/issues\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MisterL30086/Monochrome-High-Contrast-UI/blob/2.0.X-branch/assets/modrinth%20icons/issue%20toast.png?raw=true\" alt=\"issues\" /></a>\n</div>\n",
